STATEMENT: >>>
The grooming thread for the operator's 2026-09-01 direction: shift the whole
system -- grammars, plan machinery, presentation, and the board app --
toward HUMAN reasoning. The mission, in the operator's words: this branch is
designed to promote a shared understanding between human and LLM. Their
sketch of the axes, offered "on a whim, don't take literally": the what
(spec/presentation), the how/when (plan), the why (annotation), the who
(authorship).

Worked agile and HITL: no enforced order, the operator pivots to whatever
they judge the worst gap when a session works this thread. The children are
concept groups holding work items carved from the dump; each item's NOTES
carries the operator's verbatim where meaning or scope is ambiguous, so they
can separate intent from my reading. Nothing here converts to spec or
presentation nodes without a grooming session -- REQ-BOARD-GRAMMAR-DRIVEN is
the one requirement the operator explicitly offered.

Old plans are NOT superseded by this thread's existence: reconciling them
(WORK-OLD-PLANS-RECONCILE) is an explicit grooming session. Related work
living elsewhere: WORK-BOARD-FILTER-MODEL stays in whiteboard-view.
<<<
